  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Violin part only; \rimmed to 32 cm. Has decorative title page from this work bound in before number 1 in the collection. The violino primo part has a handwritten title, in ink: 3 Quatuors de Pleyel, 9e. œuvre, with, underneath, in pencil: Dedie à Boccherini. Has pages numbered in ink: 248-263, reflecting pagination within collection. Individual quartets numbered "12" in ink, reflecting position of set within the collection.</subfield>
